{"title":"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Which pair of numbers does NOT have a product equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce5d3cbb9ab0a992ed503c2d4499e4f4af2f9d65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />?\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/2/da28ee82f6729d2705f3ea8cb3ba11d8ad33b3dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ \\{-4,-9\\}\\qquad\\text{(B)}\\ \\{-3,-12\\}\\qquad\\text{(C)}\\ \\left\\{\\frac{1}{2},-72\\right\\}\\qquad\\text{(D)}\\ \\{ 1,36\\}\\qquad\\text{(E)}\\ \\left\\{\\frac{3}{2},24\\right\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"646\" height=\"43\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let's calculate each of the answer choices and see which one DOES NOT equal <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce5d3cbb9ab0a992ed503c2d4499e4f4af2f9d65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> comes out to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/8/1785ec974ea2861757e5e747e2bcfd5fc1f47612.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-4 \\times -9= 36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"113\" height=\"15\" />,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> equals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/5/be5c0ded80de859c7575c89463300aa1ca2e41ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-3 \\times -12= 36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"122\" height=\"15\" />,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/1/02101c59c0adadd80bb1ec5b9f02adfc3602cf77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2} \\times -72= -36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"126\" height=\"38\" />,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/d/29d95b2e43bc20809cb15d7ca059b8635c254e7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\times 36= 36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" />,\n</p><p>and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> equals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/6/206a048f35f4fbe1b1b8f8a198fa6191ba9d9e15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{2} \\times 24= 3 \\times 12= 36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"171\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/5/3f58d2efaaa17d28cec9dd927d78708a63b43e24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In order for a product to be positive (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce5d3cbb9ab0a992ed503c2d4499e4f4af2f9d65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />), the numbers should either be both positive or both negative. Looking at our answer choices, the only option that does not fit this description is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/5/3f58d2efaaa17d28cec9dd927d78708a63b43e24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME\" title=\"1993 AJHSME\">1993 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1993\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First<br />Question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?titl